      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 956,
        "height": 384,
        "content": "## 1. Catch the closed standup\n\nFires when a standup closes. A retried delivery, or a second run of the pinned sample, stops at the duplicate check. Nobody posted? The run ends."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "tr1600-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
